$DATUM 5-(4,4,5,5-Tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)benzo[d]isothiazole (26).
To a 250 mL, round-bottomed flask was added bis(pinacolato)diboron (5.6
g, 22 mmol), 5-bromobenzo-[d]isothiazole (25, 3.63 g, 17 mmol),30
potassium acetate (2.5 g, 25 mmol), 1,4-dioxane (100 mL),
tricyclohexylphosphine (0.68 g, 2.4 mmol), and
tris(dibenzylideneacetone)dipalladium (0) (0.93 g, 1.0 mmol). The mixture
was stirred at 80 °C overnight. After cooling to room temperature, the
solution was concentrated and purified by silica gel chromatography
(0-40% EtOAc/hexane) to afford 26 (3.2 g, 72% yield).
5-(4,4,5,5-Tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)benzo[d]isothiazole (26),
yield (3.2 g, 72%). 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3): δ ppm 1.41 (s, 12H),
7.91-8.02 (m, 2H), 8.58 (s, 1H), 8.95 (s, 1H).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM alternative reaction conditions gave lower yield
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
