$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
6-[6-(Methoxymethyl)-3-pyridinyl]-4-{[(1R)-1-(tetrahydro-2H-pyran-4-yl)ethyl]amino}-3-quinolinecarboxamide
(72). 2-(Methoxymethyl)-
5-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)pyridine (86 mg, 0.34
mmol), tetrakis(triphenylphoshine)palladium (6.11 mg, 5 μmol), and cesium
carbonate (215 mg, 0.66 mmol) were added to a stirred suspension of
6-bromo-4-{[(1S)-1-(tetrahydro-2H-pyran-4-
yl)ethyl]amino}-3-quinolinecarboxamide (100 mg, 0.26 mmol) in degassed
dioxane (2.2 mL) and water (0.25 mL) under nitrogen. The resulting
suspension was stirred at 80 °C for 2 h. The reaction mixture was then
allowed to cool to RT, concentrated, and the precipitate filtered and
washed with DCM. The filtrate was concentrated to dryness and purified by
preparative HPLC using decreasingly polar mixtures of water (containing
0.2% ammonium carbonate) and MeCN as eluent. The fractions were
evaporated to dryness.
7-Fluoro-6-[6-(methoxymethyl)pyridin-3-yl]-4-{[(1S)-1-(1-methyl-1H-pyrazol-3-yl)ethyl]amino}quinoline-3-carboxamide
(74). The title compound was prepared following the same procedure from
6-bromo-7-fluoro-4-{[(1S)-1-(1-methyl-1H-pyrazol-3-yl)ethyl]amino}-
quinoline-3-carboxamide (107 mg, 0.27 mmol) and 2-(methoxymethyl)-
5-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-yl)pyridine (204 mg, 0.82
mmol). Analytical chiral HPLC: column, Chiralcel OD-H 5 μM, 0.46 cm × 15
cm; mobile phase, 40% MeOH (0.1% DEA) in super critical CO2; flow rate 4
mL/min. 7-Fluoro-6-[6-(methoxymethyl)-3-pyridinyl]-4-{[(1S)-1-
(tetrahydro-2H-pyran-4-yl)ethyl]amino}-3-quinolinecarboxamide was
obtained as a colorless solid (85 mg, 72%). 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d 6,
303 K) 1.54 (3H, d, J 6.6), 3.41 (3H, s), 3.75 (3H, s), 4.58 (2H, s),
5.21−5.32 (1H, m), 6.17 (1H, d, J 2.2), 7.49 (1H, s), 7.54 (1H, d, J
8.1), 7.58 (1H, d, J 2.2), 7.65 (1H, d, J 12.1), 8.00 (1H, dt, J 1.9,
8.1), 8.16 (1H, s), 8.49 (1H, d, J 8.49), 8.69 (1H, s), 8.81 (1H, s),
9.76 (1H, d, J 8.3). 13C NMR (175 MHz, DMSO-d 6, 300 K) 23.9, 38.3, 51.6,
58.1, 74.5, 102.1, 107.8, 113.4, 117.1, 120.8, 122.8, 128.7, 129.2,
131.7, 136.9, 148.6, 150.9, 153.7, 154.5, 157.6, 159.0, 161.0, 170.7.
HRMS (ESI+): anal. calcd for C23H24FN6O2 (M + H)+, 435.1945; found,
435.1939. t R 1.44 min (R-isomer, t R 1.13 min); [α]D −72° in MeCN (c ∼ 2
mg/mL).
