$DATUM 5-(6-(4-(N,N-bis(4-(ethylhexyloxy)phenyl)amino)phenyl)-4,4-ethylenedioxy-4H-cyclopenta[2,1-b:
3,4-b']dithiophen-2-yl)thiophene-2-carbaldehyde (2). The aniline (1)
(0.41 g, 0.5 mmol), 5-formylthiophen-2-ylboronic acid (0.16 g, 1 mmol)
and Pd(PPh3)4 (10 mg) were dissolved in toluene (10 ml) and methanol (10
ml), and the solution was heated at reflux for 24 hours under the argon
atmosphere. To the reaction solution was added water (50 ml), and this
was extracted with dichloromethane, dried with magnesium sulfate, and
concentrated under reduced pressure. The residue was purified by silica
gel column chromatography (hexane/ dichloromethane = 1/2). Deep-red
solid, Yield: 0.30 g, (71%). 1H NMR (600 MHz, CDCl3) δ: 9.83 (s, 1H,
CHO), 7.65 (d, J= 3.6 Hz, 1H, Th-H), 7.34 (d, J= 8.4 Hz, 2H, Ph-H), 7.21
(s, 1H, c-Th-H), 7.18 (d, J= 3.6 Hz, 1H, Th-H), 7.08 (s, 1H, c-Th-H),
7.07 (d, J= 9.0 Hz, 4H, Ph-H), 6.89 (d, J= 8.4 Hz, 2H, Ph-H), 6.84 (d, J=
9.0 Hz, 4H, Ph-H), 4.53 (s, 4H, -OCH2CH2O-), 3.82 (d, J= 5.4 Hz, 4H,
-OCH2-), 1.70 (m, 2H, -CH-), 1.45 (m, 8H, -CHCH2CH2-), 1.33 (m, 8H,
-CH2-), 0.90 (m, 12H, -CH3). 13C NMR (150 MHz, CDCl3) δ: 182.23, 156.07,
151.81, 150.24, 148.83, 147.57, 140.94, 140.09, 137.51, 136.53, 135.43,
130.89, 126.90, 126.08, 125.84, 123.13, 120.29, 119.90, 116.05, 115.35,
107.58, 70.73, 65.47, 39.47, 30.56, 29.13, 23.89, 23.08, 14.12, 11.16.
HRMS (FAB+, m/z): calcd for C50H55NO5S3, 845.3243; found, 845.3242.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Suzuki coupling
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM A Novel Organic Sensitizer Combined with a Cobalt Complex Redox Shuttle
for Dye-Sensitized Solar Cells
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
