$DATUM Step 2:
1-(3-Chloro-5-oxo-5H-benzo[4,5]cyclohepta[1,2-b]pyridin-7-yl)-N-(pyridin-2-ylmethyl)methanesulfonamide
(22.04 g, 51.80 mmol), lithium
2-hydroxy-4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-2-(1-methyl-1H-pyrazol-4-yl)-1,3,2-dioxaborolan-2-uide
hydrate (25.3 g, 88.0 mmol), Pd2(dba)3 (2.37 g, 2.59 mmol), and
tricyclohexylphosphine (1.81 g, 6.47 mmol) were placed in a flask under
an atmosphere of argon. DMF (518 mL) was added, and argon was bubbled
through the solution for several minutes. The solution was then heated at
100 °C for 4 h. The mixture was cooled to room temperature, poured into
aqueous sodium hydrogen carbonate (saturated, 70 mL), and extracted with
ethyl acetate (2 × 75 mL). The coimbined organics were dried over
anhydrous Na2SO4, filtered, and concentrated under reduced pressure. The
residue was purified by column chromatography on silica gel, eluting with
EtOAc + 10% MeOH + 1% Et3N/hexanes gradient afforded compound.
1-[3-(1-Methyl-1H-pyrazol-4-yl)-5-oxo-5H-benzo[4,5]cyclohepta[1,2-b]pyridin-7-yl]-N-(pyridin-2-ylmethyl)methanesulfonamide
(11r).Yield: (17.3 g, 36.7 mmol, 71%), pale-yellow solid. 1H NMR (600
MHz, DMSO-d6) δ 9.21 (d, 1H), 8.53 (d, 1H), 8.47 (m, 1H), 8.46 (m, 1H),
8.15 (d, 1H), 8.14 (s, 1H), 7.78 (m, 4H), 7.39 (m, 2H), 7.32 (d, 1H),
7.24 (m, 1H), 4.63 (s, 2H), 4.22 (d, 1H), 3.88 (s, 3H). MS (APCI) calcd
for C25H21N5O3S [M + H]+, 472.1; found, 472.1. c-Met IC50 (nM): 1.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Discovery of
1-[3-(1-Methyl-1H-pyrazol-4-yl)-5-oxo-5H-benzo[4,5]cyclohepta[1,2-b]pyridin-7-yl]-N-(pyridin-2-ylmethyl)methanesulfonamide
(MK-8033): A Specific c-Met/Ron Dual Kinase Inhibitor with Preferential
Affinity for the Activated State of c-Met
