$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure:
(3R,3aS)-3-(hydroxymethyl)-7-(6-(hydroxymethyl)pyridin-3-yl)-3a,4-dihydrobenzo[b]oxazolo[3,4-d][1,4]oxazin-1(3H)-one
(14). A mixture of 13 (100 mg, 0.29 mmol), cesium carbonate (234 mg, 0.72
mmol), (5-bromopyridin-2-yl)methanol (83 mg, 0.44 mmol) and
tetrakis(triphenylphosphine)palladium(0) (34 mg, 0.029 mmol) in dioxane
(5 mL) and H2O (0.5 mL) was degassed and flushed with argon. The mixture
was heated at 80 °C overnight. Dichloromethane (30 mL) was added, and the
mixture was filtered through Celite, washed with water, saturated brine,
dried over sodium sulfate, and evaporated. The residue was purified by
chromatography on silica gel with dichloromethane/methanol (50:1)
afforded compound.
5-((3R,3aS)-3-(hydroxymethyl)-1-oxo-1,3,3a,4-tetrahydrobenzo[b]oxazolo[3,4-d][1,4]oxazin-7-yl)-4-methylpicolinonitrile
(58). Compound 58 (69 mg, 71%) was prepared from 13 (100 mg, 0.29 mmol)
and 3-(6-bromopyridin-3-yl) oxazolidin-2-one (87 mg, 0.44 mmol) in the
same manner as described for 14. 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6) δ 8.55 (s, 1
H), 8.04 (s, 1H), 7.98 (d, J = 8.3 Hz, 1 H), 7.09 (dd, J = 12.5, 4.2 Hz,
2 H), 5.33 (t, J = 5.7 Hz, 1 H), 4.62 - 4.54 (m, 1 H), 4.51 - 4.44 (m, 1
H), 4.13 - 4.05 (m, 2 H), 3.82 - 3.74 (m, 1 H), 3.74 - 3.65 (m, 1 H),
2.35 (s, 3 H). 13C NMR (126 MHz, DMSO-d6) δ 154.2, 151.4, 147.0, 144.7,
140.3, 132.0, 131.4, 130.9, 124.3, 122.7, 119.1, 118.1, 118.0, 76.9,
66.4, 61.3, 52.1, 19.9. MS (ESI) m/z: 336.1 [M-1]-. HRMS (ESI): Anal.
Calcd for C18H15N3O4Na: 360.0960, found: 360.0949.
