$DATUM To a stirred mixture of
3-(8-amino-1-bromo-imidazo[1,5-a]pyrazin-3-yl)-1-methylcyclobutanol (A2,
13.07 g, 0.044 mol), potassium carbonate (18.21 g, 0.13 mol) in
1,2-dimethoxyethane (240 mL) and H2O (60 mL) was added
4-ethoxy-2-phenyl-7-(4,4,5,5-tetramethyl-[1,3,2]dioxaborolan-
2-yl)-quinoline (A3-2, 18.75 g, 0.050 mol) followed by
1,1'bis-(dipenylphosphino)ferrocene) palladium dichloride (1.80 g, 0.0022
mol) under an atmosphere of nitrogen. The resulting mixture was then
heated and stirred at 90°C for 4 h. The reaction was then cooled to room
temperature, the bulk of solvent was removed under reduced pressure to
give a crude residue. It was then purified by a silica gel flash
chromatography (eluent: 1→10% methanol in methylene chloride). Product 2
(yield: 71%). 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO) δ 1.41 (s, 3H), 1.55 (t, J = 6.9 Hz,
3H), 2.40 - 2.47 (m, 4H), 3.49 (t, J = 8.7 Hz, 1H), 4.50 (q, J = 6.9 Hz,
2H), 6.18 (br. s., 2H), 7.08 (d, J = 4.8 Hz, 1H), 7.43 - 7.65 (m, 5H),
7.86 (dd, J = 8.6, 1.5 Hz, 1H), 8.17 (d, J = 1.5 Hz, 1H), 8.23 (d, J =
8.6 Hz, 1H), 8.31 (dd, J = 8.3, 1.3 Hz, 2H);13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ
14.5, 22.5, 27.2, 43.2, 64.2, 70.6, 98.9, 106.4, 114.3, 119.9, 122.6,
126.8, 127.6, 128.0, 128.7, 129.3, 134.8, 136.2, 140.2, 144.5, 149.2,
151.6, 159.5, 162.0;MS (ES+): m/z 466.42 [MH+]; HPLC: tR = 0.67 min
(Analytical_2min); HRMS (ESI): Calcd for C28H27N5O2[MH+]: 466.2243,
Found: 466.2246.
